    {
      "kind": "narration",
      "text": "第十七話　悲春風，夏蟲送，莫問天涯覓影踪"
    },
    {
      "kind": "narration",
      "text": "二零零六年十月。天文工作坊檢討。中天 soc 房。這是貝澳之前的事。"
    },
    {
      "kind": "actor",
      "action": "hide",
      "id": "lingchen"
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "speaker": "ajun",
      "text": "凌晨，這次稍微有點超支。",
      "expr": "02-laugh"
    },
    {
      "kind": "actor",
      "action": "hide",
      "id": "ajun"
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "speaker": "lingchen",
      "text": "不好意思。食物、螢光星星和天文光碟，花多了。",
      "expr": "04-cold"
    },
    {
      "kind": "actor",
      "action": "hide",
      "id": "lingchen"
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "speaker": "ajun",
      "text": "你的預算沒有列天文光碟。",
      "expr": "03-nosy"
    },
    {
      "kind": "narration",
      "text": "家綸正要解釋。凌晨打斷他。"
    },
    {
      "kind": "actor",
      "action": "hide",
      "id": "ajun"
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "speaker": "lingchen",
      "text": "這是我們先前安排失誤，忘記了個人問答的獎品。家綸臨時提議燒光碟。學會在這件事上賠了錢，不好意思。",
      "expr": "05-fire"
    },
    {
      "kind": "actor",
      "action": "hide",
      "id": "lingchen"
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "speaker": "ajun",
      "text": "幾張光碟也花不了多少。財政沒問題了。散會吧。",
      "expr": "04-gasp"
    },
    {
      "kind": "narration",
      "text": "散會後，家綸把凌晨拉到泳池邊。"
    },
    {
      "kind": "actor",
      "action": "hide",
      "id": "ajun"
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "speaker": "jialun",
      "text": "那些光碟的錢我自己付就可以，怎麼你又去跟學會報？",
      "expr": "03-stammer"
    },
    {
      "kind": "actor",
      "action": "hide",
      "id": "jialun"
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "speaker": "lingchen",
      "text": "以學會名義派的禮物，用學會的錢。中天的錢還夠，多一點零錢不用不好意思。",
      "expr": "01-shrug"
    },
    {
      "kind": "actor",
      "action": "hide",
      "id": "lingchen"
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "speaker": "jialun",
      "text": "可是那些光碟是我自把自為弄的。",
      "expr": "04-sad"
    },
    {
      "kind": "actor",
      "action": "hide",
      "id": "jialun"
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "speaker": "lingchen",
      "text": "你知道自己自把自為也就好了。下次要堅持，先跟我們商量。一場拍檔，犯不著你瞞我、我瞞你。",
      "expr": "01-shrug"
    },
    {
      "kind": "actor",
      "action": "hide",
      "id": "lingchen"
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "speaker": "jialun",
      "text": "對不起。請你原諒。",
      "expr": "05-nod"
    },
    {
      "kind": "actor",
      "action": "hide",
      "id": "jialun"
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "speaker": "lingchen",
      "text": "哈哈，幹嘛說對不起？一場兄弟，有甚麼原諒不原諒的？我之前不是誇過你嗎？這種當機立斷，才像個大丈夫。黑加侖子長大了。",
      "expr": "02-blush"
    },
    {
      "kind": "narration",
      "text": "他跟著笑了。"
    },
    {
      "kind": "jump",
      "to": "ch17-shore"
    }
  ]
}
